00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:40,180
That adds up to 2,800 pounds.

247
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:44,880
2,800 pounds can lift 73,500 pounds.

248
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:47,020
The mechanical muscles that move these blades

249
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:49,280
come in the form of three GE engines

250
00:12:49,281 --> 00:12:51,480
that produce 12,000 horsepower.

251
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:54,280
We're not worried about how much power we have to pull

252
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:56,480
to make a turn or climb or descend.

253
00:12:56,580 --> 00:12:59,920
We've got it there at our fingertips.

254
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:01,360
When you're operating in environments

255
00:13:01,460 --> 00:13:03,420
where it's very difficult to travel over roads,

256
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:04,900
especially in the environment we've

